    <h5>{"CloudWatch Logs Insights: 特定のアクセスキーの操作を新しい順に確認"}</h5>
    {"\n                "}
    <div className="code-sample"><div className="code-lang">Logs Insights</div><div className="code-block" tabIndex={0} role="region" aria-label="logs insights コード例"><div className="code-line">{"fields @timestamp, eventName, eventSource, userIdentity.arn, sourceIPAddress, awsRegion"}</div><div className="code-line">{"| filter userIdentity.accessKeyId = "}<span className="hljs-string">{"\"AKIAEXAMPLEEXAMPLE\""}</span>{""}</div><div className="code-line">{"| sort @timestamp desc"}</div><div className="code-line">{"| limit "}<span className="hljs-number">{"100"}</span>{""}</div></div></div>
    {"\n                "}
    <h5>{"Athena: 不審な IAM ユーザーの操作を時系列に確認 (CloudTrail テーブル)"}</h5>
    {"\n                "}
    <div className="code-sample"><div className="code-lang">SQL</div><div className="code-block" tabIndex={0} role="region" aria-label="sql コード例"><div className="code-line">{"SELECT eventtime,"}</div><div className="code-line">{"       eventname,"}</div><div className="code-line">{"       eventsource,"}</div><div className="code-line">{"       useridentity.arn AS principal,"}</div><div className="code-line">{"       sourceipaddress,"}</div><div className="code-line">{"       errorcode"}</div><div className="code-line">{"FROM cloudtrail_logs"}</div><div className="code-line">{"WHERE useridentity.accesskeyid = 'AKIAEXAMPLEEXAMPLE'"}</div><div className="code-line">{"  AND eventtime BETWEEN '"}<span className="hljs-number">{"2026"}</span>{"-"}<span className="hljs-number">{"10"}</span>{"-"}<span className="hljs-attr">{"10T00"}</span>{":"}<span className="hljs-attr">{"00"}</span>{":00Z' AND '"}<span className="hljs-number">{"2026"}</span>{"-"}<span className="hljs-number">{"10"}</span>{"-"}<span className="hljs-attr">{"17T00"}</span>{":"}<span className="hljs-attr">{"00"}</span>{":00Z'"}</div><div className="code-line">{"ORDER BY eventtime;"}</div></div></div>
    {"\n                "}
    <h5>{"\n                    Athena: 特定の ENI からの外向き通信量を宛先別に集計 (VPC Flow Logs テーブル)\n                "}</h5>
    {"\n                "}
    <div className="code-sample"><div className="code-lang">SQL</div><div className="code-block" tabIndex={0} role="region" aria-label="sql コード例"><div className="code-line">{"SELECT dstaddr,"}</div><div className="code-line">{"       dstport,"}</div><div className="code-line">{"       SUM(bytes) AS total_bytes"}</div><div className="code-line">{"FROM vpc_flow_logs"}</div><div className="code-line">{"WHERE interface_id = 'eni-0123456789abcdef0'"}</div><div className="code-line">{"  AND action = 'ACCEPT'"}</div><div className="code-line">{"GROUP BY dstaddr, dstport"}</div><div className="code-line">{"ORDER BY total_bytes DESC"}</div><div className="code-line">{"LIMIT "}<span className="hljs-number">{"20"}</span>{";"}</div></div></div>
    {"\n                "}
    <blockquote>{"\n                    "}<p>{"\n                        テーブル名と列名は、ログの形式や作成したテーブル定義に依存します。上記は考え方を示す例です。\n                    "}</p>{"\n                "}</blockquote>
